OL,3,GNEWSA'Good cask ale' key to the perfect
OL,4,Apub, says award-winning landlady
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shortlist was announced last week
OL,7,Ffor the Campaign for Real Ale's (Camra)
OL,8,FNational Pub of the Year.
OL,10,FThe Turks Head, in St Helens, joins
OL,11,Fthree others hoping to land the
OL,12,Fultimate prize.
OL,14,FThere are more than 40,000 pubs in the
OL,15,FUnited Kingdom, of which only five have
OL,16,Fmade it into every edition of Camra's
OL,17,Fannual Good Beer Guide since it was
OL,18,Ffirst published it in 1974.
OL,20,FThe Roscoe Head, in Liverpool, is one
OL,21,Fof them.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
